    {
      "name": "@pcmid/dsh-edit-prompt",
      "title": {
        "en": "Edit and resend prompts",
        "zh": "编辑并重发提示词"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Adds an edit button beside the copy button of each message you sent. Edit the text and send it: that turn and everything after it are dropped, and the conversation restarts from the edited prompt. Images in the message are sent again; the original conversation is archived by default.",
        "zh": "在你发出的每条消息的复制按钮旁加一个编辑按钮。改好内容后发送，这一轮及之后的所有消息都会被丢弃，对话从修改后的提示词重新开始。消息里的图片会一起重发；默认把原会话移入归档。"
      },
      "icon": "data:image/svg+xml;base64,",
      "author": "pcmid",
